    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"Let the lights go out and finally rest\"... that sounds almost peaceful when you put it like that. But it feels so heavy. Is it really just a matter of logic? To just stop because the purpose is gone? I've always believed in the dignity of a full life, but right now, I can't see the dignity in being a burden to a world that doesn't even recognize me anymore.",
